# OPTIONAL escape hatch for python scripts that need packages beyond the
# curated set in the published volts_scripter image (requests).
#
# To use it:
#   1. cp scripts/requirements.txt.sample scripts/requirements.txt
#   2. add your pinned dependencies below (flat file only — no -r/-c/editables)
#   3. re-run ./run.sh — no image rebuild
#
# First run (or after editing this file / rebuilding the scripter image) runs
# pip install --target into tmp/scripter-deps/ (needs PyPI). Later runs hit the
# cache. Wipe with: rm -rf tmp/scripter-deps
# scripts/requirements.txt is gitignored — local, per-host choice.
#
# example:
# dnspython==2.7.0
